        ('b', '09.03', t('目标用户', 'Intended users'), t('目标用户已经有持续的创作项目。他们需要接上已有的积累，而不是更多从零开始的建议。', 'The users already have ongoing creative projects. They need to build on what they have, not get more advice that starts from zero.')),
